# AIRMOSAIC_ASSETS_DIR points to assets/ beside the source checkout.
# Data is shared by stage/name/version; results are grouped by project/run/stage.
# Path names only. Configure distinct absolute directories outside Git checkouts.
# The core reads AIRMOSAIC_ASSETS_DIR; CONFIG_DIR/AUTH_DIR are caller conventions.
# This file is documentation only; the current CLI does not load .env files.
# Use config/examples/environment.ps1 for explicit PowerShell session setup.
# Never put real paths, account names, passwords, tokens or cookies in this example.
AIRMOSAIC_ASSETS_DIR=
AIRMOSAIC_CONFIG_DIR=
AIRMOSAIC_AUTH_DIR=
